# Security

- Validate all input with Zod on the server.
- Enforce authentication before authorization.
- Escape/sanitize user-generated content; avoid `dangerouslySetInnerHTML`.
- Never leak stack traces or internal errors to clients.
- Rate-limit login; httpOnly secure cookies.
- Non-superuser DB role in production `DATABASE_URL`.
- Follow `docs/security.md` and VPS isolation guidelines under `/srv`.
